      "writtenOn": "2023-03-31T18:01:58Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I am open to other alternatives. Here are some that I considered:\n\n1. java_sdk_library creates java_api_library _instead_ of droidstubs (for stubs)\n2. update depsMutator to rewrite libs and append a `.from-text` suffix\n\nI think (1) is the correct long-term approach. But it makes debugging more difficult in the short term since the ninja graph will not contain both the \"source stubs\" and \"txt stubs\" for diff-ing \n\n(2) is more multi-tree friendly, but requires use of a global for storing list of stub libraries",
      "revId": "1581931b6aee4b50420e03b7b24d973fb561791d",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
